---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><BaseHead title={`Now — ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="What Andrew Dobrow is working on and thinking about right now." /></head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <header class="page-heading">
        <h1>Now</h1>
        <p>What I'm up to lately. <span class="updated">Updated November 12, 2026.</span></p>
      </header>

<article class="prose now-content">

<p>        
<ul> 
<li>training our nine-year-old dog, proving you can treat old dogs new tricks.</li>
<li>tweaking SEO elements on <a href="https://treasurecoast.today">Treasure Coast Today.</a></li>
<li>sending cold emails to local businesses for sponsored articles.</li>
<li>brainstorming ideas and working on drafts for multiple blogs.</li>
<li>trying to decide which book I'd like to commit to.</li>
<li>preparing to sell Treasure Coast Notary Service, my mobile notary business.</li>
<li>helping my grandfather with marketing for his book.</li></p>

        <h2>Reading</h2>
        <p><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/92610.Rocannon_s_World">Rocannon’s World</a> by Ursula K. Le Guin</p>

        <p class="now-explainer">This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">/now page</a>: a simple, periodically updated answer to “what are you up to these days?”</p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
<style>
.updated { white-space: nowrap; color: #87918b; font-size: .84rem; }
.now-content strong { font-weight: 700; }
.now-explainer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 40px !important; padding-top: 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .87rem; }
</style>
